  "exploratory": true,
  "exploratory_reason": "Designed after the sealed headfix run, which located a resolved loss at Z -> HEAD_LAT. This run splits that step into teddy_mm's own operations (unit-length input, linear 1, SiLU, linear 2, SiLU, linear 3) to locate it further. A method chosen after observing responses gives exploratory evidence and leaves the headfix classifications unchanged (ANM paper p. 8).\n",
